    },
    {
        "text": "'Scuse me~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Scuse meee, anyone in\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aw, man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody in? Morniiiing\u2014Mooorniiiing\u2014Just checkiiiiing\u2014Anyone iiiiiiiin\u2014! Halllll\u2014looooooo\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh, actually deserted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's sucky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wasting my time somewhere empty-handed ain't my style. Hm-hmm, I'm here after all. Let's let your li'l Peter Pan of Lungmen, Rope, take a look, see what nice stuff's lying around...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait, no!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(Claps face)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stoppit, stoppit, Rope. Pull it in. You can't do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(Claps face) (Claps face)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, what a scary habit to have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you can't leave the door unlocked when no-one's in. That's just too sloppy. You can't blame anyone else when you lose something, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "I swear I won't take anything. Just looking, looking...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just lemme looksie, scope what's good around here~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? What's on the ground here... iunno. Who cares? Let's jump it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "jump",
        "xpos": 20,
        "power": 60,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "jump",
        "xpos": -20,
        "power": 20,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hohoh, these flowers are real pretty with their colors. Dunno if they're worth anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, this ain't equipment you see everyday. Probably pretty expensive, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "And over this way's... herbs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Hmm?? Whoooa, what IS this smell? This is pungent!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
