    },
    {
        "text": "Pteh\u2014haah, close call!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, crap, I thought I was about to faint. That was way too risky...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Better to jimmy open a Lungmen treasury box than charge an open door.' No wonder a mentor once said that. Kinda makes sense now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, okay, the joke ends here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "If nobody's in, then I'm all hands tied. Wanted to do a little good for once, too. Whatevs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I'll just come next time\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
