    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, I'm not the only one on the down-low?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehey, now this is getting interesting. Wherever you came from, li'l dodger, let's have a duel~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#4"
    },
    {
