        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm-hmm~, hmm~, hm-hmm hm-hmm~~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, esscuse me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And add just a little culture. Hmm, that should be a good amount!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, c'mon, you're way too focused.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then mix it with the deep soil here. Oh, or perhaps add a little bit more plant ash?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhmm, this should do it just nicely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Has she literally not noticed me? You need to keep your wits about you, y'know?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(And here I thought some thief actually got in. Eugh.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... the balance still seems a little off. Last time's cultivar had balance issues too. Phew, let me think, what should I do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Peat, akadama... maintain weak acidity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Still talking to herself. Is this, like, an okay situation?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh, but watching from the side is pretty fun~)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, how could I forget! I can try adding in some sandy soil brought from where it grew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_181_flower_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhmm, no matter plants or people, they're all best at home!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Perfumer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_236_rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Kind of makes sense to hear.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But y'know the sort who really work to flee the nest? Never wanna go back, those people? Uh, people? Plants? Whatever, same thing. There's plenty of them, right?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rope"
